    (option-some-of [:option :string] 
      "cloud-itonami-assoc-9411-bra-cni Wave 0 (ADR-2607141700): 30 CNI entries, each citing a CNI or FGV CPDOC source with the verbatim span it rests on. Extend data/datascript-tx.edn and regenerate; never fabricate an id/url.")
